{
  "uid": "fusion-internal",
  "title": "fusion-pipeline internal",
  "description": "Overview (throughput, latency, backlog, failures, CPU, memory), one row per stage, Internals collapsed. Spec: docs/specs/2026-09-08-observability-pipeline-poc.md, Telemetry.",
  "tags": [
    "fusion-pipeline",
    "internal"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 15,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Tenant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(records_in_total, tenant)",
          "refId": "tenant"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(records_in_total, tenant)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "stage",
        "label": "Stage",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(records_in_total{stage!=\"source\"}, stage)",
          "refId": "stage"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(records_in_total{stage!=\"source\"}, stage)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 999,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this board** \u2014 every chart has history; hover for the exact value, the legend shows *Last / Max / Mean* for the window, widen the time range top-right for more.  \n**Healthy:** *in* \u2248 *out*, *errored* flat at 0, *waiting in NATS* flat, *end-to-end p99* under the dashed 1 s line.  \n**Something wrong?** *Is anything failing?* names the node \u2192 open its **Stage** row below. Slow? *slowest stage p99* names it \u2192 its *Time per record*. Costly? *What does it cost?*. Filter by **Tenant** / **Stage** top-left."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is the pipeline healthy?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Are records flowing?  (in \u2192 out, dropped, errored)",
      "description": "in: records the source handed to the engine. out: sink writes with durable acceptance (PubAck). dropped: on purpose, see Drops by reason. errored: failed in a stage or a sink; each one naks its message.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "in"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "out"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "dropped"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "errored"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(records_in_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\",stage=\"source\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "in",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(sink_publish_duration_seconds_count{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m])) - sum(rate(sink_publish_errors_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "out",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(records_dropped_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "dropped",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(records_errored_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "errored",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "How slow?  (end to end, and the slowest stage)",
      "description": "End-to-end: observed time on the record to settlement. Slowest stage p99: the worst stage run or sink PubAck wait right now; find which in the per-stage rows below. Rule of thumb: watch above 1 s, problem above 5 s. Gaps are minutes with no records: latency is undefined without them; the grey bars show how many records the number is based on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "no records in this window"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "records settled /s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.drawStyle",
                "value": "bars"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 25
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "reqps"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "gray"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "records/s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(pipeline_end_to_end_seconds_bucket{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "end-to-end p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(pipeline_end_to_end_seconds_bucket{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "end-to-end p99",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, stage) (rate(stage_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant=~\"$tenant\",stage=~\"$stage\"}[1m]) or rate(sink_publish_duration_seconds_bucket{tenant=~\"$tenant\",stage=~\"$stage\"}[1m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "slowest stage p99",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pipeline_end_to_end_seconds_count{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "records settled /s",
          "refId": "V"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Is NATS backing up?  (waiting, in flight, redelivered)",
      "description": "Waiting grows when the pipeline is slower than the producer. In flight is what the workers hold. Redelivered means naks or lost acks. Rule of thumb: watch above 100, problem above 1000.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "waiting in NATS"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "in flight (unacked)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "redelivered"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(jetstream_consumer_num_pending{consumer_name=\"pipeline\"})",
          "legendFormat": "waiting in NATS",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(jetstream_consumer_num_ack_pending{consumer_name=\"pipeline\"})",
          "legendFormat": "in flight (unacked)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(jetstream_consumer_num_redelivered{consumer_name=\"pipeline\"})",
          "legendFormat": "redelivered",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Is anything failing?  (errors, naks, redeliveries)",
      "description": "Flat at zero is healthy. errored counts a stage error or a sink without PubAck once, under its node; each failed record naks; JetStream redelivers up to max_deliver, then the dead-letter queue (#10) takes it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "naks"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "redeliveries"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "dead-lettered"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (stage) (rate(records_errored_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "errored @ {{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(source_naks_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "naks",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(source_redeliveries_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "redeliveries",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(dlq_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[1m]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "dead-lettered",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "What does it cost?  CPU (cores)",
      "description": "Cores in use, self-reported. Pipeline: one line per instance from process.cpu.time. NATS: varz cpu. Dragonfly does not export CPU.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(process_cpu_time_seconds_total{job=\"fusion-pipeline\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "pipeline {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "gnatsd_varz_cpu / 100",
          "legendFormat": "nats",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "What does it cost?  memory (RSS)",
      "description": "Resident memory, self-reported: pipeline process.memory.usage per instance, NATS varz mem, Dragonfly used_memory_rss.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "process_memory_usage_bytes{job=\"fusion-pipeline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "pipeline {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "gnatsd_varz_mem",
          "legendFormat": "nats",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "dragonfly_used_memory_rss_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "dragonfly",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1000,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Source (NATS in)  \u2014  what the engine did before any stage ran",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
